# Build context for docker/bombadil/Dockerfile is the repository root, because
# the image bakes in spec/. Without this file the three upstream checkouts
# (hundreds of megabytes) would be uploaded to the daemon on every build.
#
# Note this file applies only to root-context builds; the Zulip image is built
# with docker/zulip-seeded/ as its context.
zulip/
docker-zulip/
bombadil/
docker/zulip-seeded/
features/
out/
.env
.git/
PLAN.md
README.md
Makefile
compose.yaml
spec/node_modules/
spec/package-lock.json
